<title>UK: Mowlem completes Exploration purchase.</title>
<headline>Mowlem completes Exploration purchase.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's John Mowlem and Co Plc said on Thursday it had completed the purchase of Exploration Associates Ltd from Northumbrian Water Group Plc for 4.05 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>The construction group said that Exploration would become part of its environmental services group.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
